### Application Ownership
The application has defined owners to ensure accountability
and proper lifecycle management.

### Group-Based Access
Access to the application is assigned through groups rather
than individual users.(In company with a P1 or P2 level license)

On the free tier access is given through each user. Not meant for large company. 

### App Roles
The application uses roles (Reader, Admin) to enforce
least privilege within the app itself.
Roles are assigned to groups for scalability.
